{
  "chapter": 2,
  "title": "Jiafei Victory",
  "scriptId": "ch0201",
  "endReturnScreen": "selector",
  "entries": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "It seems that you do have potential and you are quite talented actually. But you must know something.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "On your rise to popularity, you will get haters, your fans will be called creeps.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "You say that it’s weird that people are obsessed with me, but don’t you think people will think your future fans would be weird for being obsessed with a virtual anime girl with a robotic voice?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "She got a point.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh please, all you can sing is genital words.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "That’s what fan spaces are for.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "Being an idol is not just about being idolised. It’s about creating a community, a safe space, a family for like minded people.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "That’s why I have so many fans! Because I love them all very much.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Sorry…. I understand now. I shouldn’t judge covers by their books.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "Isn’t it the other way around?",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Oh shut up.",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "Oh yeah, and take a magical egg spinner. 5 RMB only, you won’t regret it!",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Miku",
      "text": "Okay miss Pinduoduo…",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "CupcakKe",
      "text": "Bye my queen",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
      "bgmVolume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Jiafei",
      "text": "See you in Floptropica",
      "background": "",
      "voice": "",
      "fontPath": "",
      "icon": "",
      "iconFrameCount": 1,
      "iconFps": 8.0,
      "autoAdvanceOnVoiceEnd": false,
      "bgm": "",
